WEBVTT

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:03.560
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:06.110
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:07.110
What are we going to do?

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:10.100
Nana's egg has become a giant ? Egg!

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:13.900
It's so sad that Amu-chan and Lulu-chan are fighting.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:16.820
It'll be fine! Believe in Amu-chan!

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:19.170
Yeah, let's believe in her!

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:21.530
And in all of the Guardians, too!

00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:23.630
Don't y'all forget to believe in Lulu, now!

00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:25.000
Doki!

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:51.360
I'm gonna tell you a secret.

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:54.270
Don't tell <i>anyone</i>, okay?

00:00:54.270 --> 00:00:57.160
Even though I'm not girly at all,

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:59.930
two certain boys said they like me!

00:00:59.930 --> 00:01:02.870
Jump up a bit into the sky.

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:05.750
My dearest friends are always there.

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:08.580
Even if you suddenly Character Change,

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:11.490
I'll be there to stop you with my great big heart.

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:14.360
Pinky swear!

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:16.760
Cross my heart!

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:19.970
Lucky, happy, leave it to me!

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:23.020
That'd be universal peace, but...

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:25.770
I'll end up protectin' everyone's hearts.

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:28.540
Let's all smile together!

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:31.400
Lucky, happy, leave it to me!

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:34.210
That's world peace! Yeah, that!

00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:37.440
Everyone has dreams, so I'm gonna protect 'em!

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:40.260
Make a victory sign together!

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:59.930
Episode 89
Heart to Heart

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:06.970
Nana...

00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:10.400
Forgive me...

00:02:14.870 --> 00:02:16.030
Nana-chan!

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:40.010
I ain't gonna let anyone get in my way!

00:02:57.570 --> 00:02:59.580
Thank you, Mashiro-san.

00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:01.240
Don't let your guard down.

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:19.380
Yaya-chan!

00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:27.290
Guys!

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:29.180
Amu-chan!

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:37.190
Do it.

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:43.250
Can you escape from it?

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:54.210
Amu-chan!

00:03:56.230 --> 00:03:59.590
How can I be so powerless at a time like this...

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:05.190
Nana, I'm sorry.

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:07.970
But I need you to lend me your strength.

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:17.980
Lulu!

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:19.320
Amu-chan!

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:23.220
Lulu!

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:42.130
Character Transformation: Dream Dream!

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:44.640
Lulu-chan...

00:04:44.640 --> 00:04:45.800
Stop it!

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:48.350
Stop using people's dreams like this!

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:49.780
Why?

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:52.960
They're all kids who know nothin' 'bout what they dream of becoming.

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:55.970
They're uncertain, e'ry one of 'em!

00:04:55.970 --> 00:04:58.370
So that makes it okay to use them?

00:04:58.370 --> 00:05:01.340
Each dream represents a ton of possibilities!

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:04.100
They're supposed to bloom into big, beautiful flowers!

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:04.360
Lulu!

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:07.160
That's enough from you.

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:23.970
Hurry up and get over 'ere, Embryo!

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:26.350
I can't keep this up!

00:05:26.350 --> 00:05:28.440
Haven't you chased me enough already?!

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:38.270
Tadase!

00:05:55.950 --> 00:05:57.210
Nagihiko!

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:59.910
Unfortunately, this is all I can do.

00:06:01.260 --> 00:06:04.090
Amu-chan's having a rough time. If we retreat temporarily-

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:05.760
What are you saying?

00:06:06.430 --> 00:06:09.930
We've got to do this, for everyone's dreams!

00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:15.110
You're right. We have to save them all!

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:39.340
Lulu!

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:43.530
Y'all still 'ere?!

00:06:43.530 --> 00:06:45.780
I said I ain't got no business with y'all!

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:51.060
Lulu, would your mother be happy with what you're doing?

00:06:51.060 --> 00:06:52.500
That again?

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:56.770
It's crystal clear to me that Maman'd be pleased to sparkle like she used to!

00:06:56.770 --> 00:07:00.280
All right, say she is pleased. Are you okay with that?

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:04.610
All for that, you selfishly used Nana.

00:07:04.840 --> 00:07:06.380
Are you really okay with that?

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:08.300
Nana...

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:13.680
Earlier, you said all those ? Eggs were to make everyone's dreams come true,

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:16.700
but weren't you just trying to fulfill your own?

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:20.270
You forced your own dream onto others!

00:07:20.270 --> 00:07:21.750
Will you do the same to your mom?

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:26.710
Force... my mother?

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:31.460
No, that's not true... Because I...

00:07:31.460 --> 00:07:35.710
I don't even know what my dream <i>is</i>!

00:07:42.700 --> 00:07:44.860
I'm the same!

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:51.100
I don't know what my dream is either!

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:03.020
So if that's true, shouldn't you try to find it?

00:08:03.020 --> 00:08:06.380
Maybe you can't see it now, maybe you don't understand it...

00:08:07.110 --> 00:08:08.830
But I'm sure you'll find it.

00:08:10.950 --> 00:08:12.510
You'll find your dream.

00:08:14.440 --> 00:08:17.500
My... dream...

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:23.640
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:26.040
Open Heart!

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:25.150
You guys...

00:09:25.880 --> 00:09:27.040
Where's Nana?

00:09:31.980 --> 00:09:32.630
Nana!

00:09:33.610 --> 00:09:34.940
Nana?

00:09:34.940 --> 00:09:36.210
Nana!

00:09:36.210 --> 00:09:37.750
Nana!

00:09:38.630 --> 00:09:43.370
If their bearer doesn't care for them, a Guardian Character will disappear.

00:09:43.370 --> 00:09:47.190
Because Guardian Characters are born from their strong feelings.

00:09:48.410 --> 00:09:50.370
I'm sorry, Nana!

00:09:50.370 --> 00:09:54.050
I was only thinking about myself!

00:09:54.050 --> 00:09:57.190
I didn't consider you at all!

00:09:58.650 --> 00:09:59.800
Nana...

00:10:10.350 --> 00:10:12.090
Howdy, y'all!

00:10:14.310 --> 00:10:16.190
Nana!

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:19.440
Nana...

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:23.380
You had me so scared.

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:28.100
Well, sorry 'bout that, but you really did a number on me there.

00:10:28.570 --> 00:10:29.500
I'm sorry.

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:31.020
Don't you fret about it.

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:35.780
Now, ain't it 'bout time for you to apologize to your friends?

00:10:37.060 --> 00:10:39.950
I... went a bit overboard.

00:10:41.110 --> 00:10:44.360
Phew... For a while there, I couldn't tell how this was gonna turn out.

00:10:44.360 --> 00:10:47.290
All you did was run around in circles, though.

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:51.020
Sorry, y'all.

00:10:51.020 --> 00:10:51.800
It's fine!

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:53.700
No hard feelings.

00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:55.750
Just don't extract any more ? Eggs.

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:57.640
No more extractin' for us!

00:10:57.640 --> 00:10:58.760
Right, Lulu?

00:10:59.060 --> 00:11:01.050
Right. I promise.

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:02.520
In that case...

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:04.400
Pinky swear.

00:11:04.400 --> 00:11:07.390
In Japan, this is one way we make promises.

00:11:09.940 --> 00:11:17.000
Pinky swear! If I chance to tell a lie, cross my heart and hope to die!

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:18.870
Pinky swear!

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:30.530
Lulu!

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:35.650
Maman? What are you doing here in that outfit?

00:11:35.650 --> 00:11:37.920
Filming for a variety show.

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:44.390
Maman, forgive me.

00:11:44.690 --> 00:11:46.910
You don't have to apologize,

00:11:46.910 --> 00:11:49.700
because I know how you feel, Lulu.

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:52.020
You've been working really hard for my sake, haven't you?

00:11:53.070 --> 00:11:55.980
Maman, you knew what I was doing?

00:11:56.330 --> 00:12:00.070
Well... All that matters is that I understand.

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:02.030
I'm your mother, after all!

00:12:25.230 --> 00:12:29.530
Lulu, do you not like it when I appear on variety shows?

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:31.120
Not really...

00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:32.410
I see.

00:12:33.670 --> 00:12:36.650
I wanted to help you be a real actress again.

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:42.990
And why do you want me to act in movies so badly?

00:12:43.930 --> 00:12:48.490
Grandmother told me that I should seek perfection in whatever I do.

00:12:49.730 --> 00:12:51.000
Just for that?

00:12:53.020 --> 00:12:54.280
The jewelry...

00:12:56.070 --> 00:12:59.630
The jewelry I made for you back then...

00:13:08.480 --> 00:13:10.390
So, how do I look?

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:12.270
Stunning!

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:18.680
I think it's because of this jewelry you made for me.

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:21.900
It's perfect, Lulu!

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:29.370
You told me it was perfect...

00:13:33.430 --> 00:13:35.290
I'm sorry.

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:39.710
I said something that unintentionally burdened you.

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:41.090
Maman...

00:13:41.470 --> 00:13:45.370
I told you before that I understand you because I'm your mother...

00:13:45.940 --> 00:13:48.090
But the truth is I've failed you, haven't I?

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:49.550
Not at all!

00:13:52.110 --> 00:13:57.370
Do you know why I wanted to take a break from movies and move back to Japan?

00:13:58.550 --> 00:14:00.190
Because of something your father told me.

00:14:01.530 --> 00:14:06.400
He said you were always waiting for me to come home.

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:18.040
Film shoots are long, right?

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:20.730
You never know when you'll get home,

00:14:20.730 --> 00:14:24.280
and sometimes you have to go on location and can't go back at all.

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:28.220
Because of that, I made you lonely.

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:30.550
So that's why?

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:37.480
By taking work on Japanese variety shows, you'd get to see me every day.

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:41.740
I didn't want to make you lonely anymore.

00:14:42.380 --> 00:14:44.190
Maman...

00:14:44.470 --> 00:14:48.110
I assumed that was what you wanted, so I just decided...

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:50.780
I really have failed as a mother.

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:59.180
No, you pass with flying colors.

00:14:59.180 --> 00:15:01.400
You're the World's #1 Mom.

00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:02.880
Lulu...

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:05.730
You're the World's #1 Daughter.

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:12.430
Eureka, yeehaw!

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:18.380
If y'all pour hacchou miso on a pork cutlet, it makes for one darn tasty meal!

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:20.010
That's just miso katsu.

00:15:20.010 --> 00:15:21.520
It already exists.

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:25.270
S-S-Say it ain't so!

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:28.220
Honestly, Papa, get a clue!

00:15:28.220 --> 00:15:31.920
Besides, hasn't Maman made miso katsu for us before?

00:15:31.920 --> 00:15:34.450
I can't believe you'd forget the taste!

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:36.770
Are you even listening to me?

00:15:36.770 --> 00:15:38.320
Oh, oopsie...

00:15:38.320 --> 00:15:43.550
Sheesh, Papa, you're always forgettin' the important stuff.

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:41.420
All's well that end's well.

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:54.510
Peaceful, isn't it?

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:56.510
Yeah, there's nothing like peace.

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:57.350
Yeah...

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:59.020
No kiddin'!

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:00.240
Nana!

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:01.880
So then, that means...

00:16:01.880 --> 00:16:03.190
Lulu!

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:04.360
Don't be <i>too</i> surprised.

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:06.360
What brings you here?

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:09.880
Lulu has something she needs to talk with you about.

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:12.050
It's nothing major.

00:16:12.050 --> 00:16:14.110
Ah! Banana youkan!

00:16:14.420 --> 00:16:16.290
I've been wanting to try this!

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:20.940
Eat up, y'all!

00:16:20.940 --> 00:16:22.320
This stuff again?

00:16:22.320 --> 00:16:25.120
Just don't eat so much you get sick.

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:26.690
That's right.

00:16:26.690 --> 00:16:28.610
Yeah, I'm real sorry 'bout that...

00:16:28.610 --> 00:16:30.280
What a little piggy!

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:32.930
So what did you want to talk about?

00:16:33.280 --> 00:16:34.680
Let me make this clear:

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:41.260
It's true that I started the so-called ? Egg Plan for Easter,

00:16:41.260 --> 00:16:44.260
but I've never approved of the way that company does things.

00:16:44.260 --> 00:16:48.320
I just want to make sure you guys know that.

00:16:48.580 --> 00:16:49.820
Okay!

00:16:50.080 --> 00:16:54.300
Hey, do you happen to know why Easter wants the Embryo?

00:16:54.300 --> 00:16:56.750
They never said.

00:16:56.750 --> 00:16:58.280
I got it!

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:01.010
I bet it's because they want to take over the world!

00:17:01.010 --> 00:17:03.830
Taking over the world is so cliché nowadays.

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:06.040
It is?!

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:07.870
Cliché!

00:17:08.930 --> 00:17:12.420
You're not working for Easter anymore, right?

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:17.410
Right. Once they started the Death Rebel Plan, they said they no longer needed me.

00:17:17.410 --> 00:17:19.930
The plan Tsukiyomi Ikuto's involved with?

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:26.880
The Director is quite confident that he's going to get the Embryo this time.

00:17:26.880 --> 00:17:31.940
Hey, if they continue with that plan, will you help us?

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:32.740
Nope, I can't.

00:17:33.040 --> 00:17:34.640
Why not?

00:17:34.640 --> 00:17:36.780
I'm going back to France.

00:17:42.670 --> 00:17:46.970
Yes, yes. I look forward to working with you.

00:17:49.780 --> 00:17:52.340
I took a job filming a movie in Paris.

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:53.470
All right!

00:17:53.470 --> 00:17:56.870
Très bien, my sweet pea!

00:17:56.870 --> 00:17:58.990
But I imposed certain conditions.

00:17:58.990 --> 00:18:02.580
Firstly, I must be able to come back to Japan for variety shows once in a while.

00:18:03.940 --> 00:18:08.560
And secondly, I want to have plenty of time for my family.

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:09.820
Maman...

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:27.150
Yep, gotta have milk after a bath, for sure!

00:18:27.150 --> 00:18:28.780
It's the best!

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:38.720
So Lulu-chan and Nana-chan are going back to France?

00:18:38.960 --> 00:18:40.370
Yeah...

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:42.730
I'm going to miss them.

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:46.600
I hope we can still be friends.

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:48.380
We will be.

00:18:48.380 --> 00:18:51.860
Whether we're in Japan or France, we'll always be friends.

00:18:51.860 --> 00:18:53.180
That's right!

00:18:53.180 --> 00:18:54.640
Friends forever!

00:18:54.640 --> 00:18:56.170
And ever!

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:03.700
My goodness, his sleeping patterns are just awful.

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:07.030
I wonder if he was searching for Ikuto all day again today.

00:19:07.030 --> 00:19:08.670
Probably.

00:19:08.670 --> 00:19:12.670
Easter intends to use Ikuto for its Death Rebel Plan, right?

00:19:12.970 --> 00:19:14.550
Yeah...

00:19:14.550 --> 00:19:16.450
I feel sorry for Yoru.

00:19:16.450 --> 00:19:19.340
He hasn't seen Ikuto in a while...

00:19:19.570 --> 00:19:21.840
Sardines-nya...

00:19:22.860 --> 00:19:24.320
Ouch!

00:19:24.320 --> 00:19:26.100
What're you doing, you freeloading cat?

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:28.100
Why're you in such a huff?

00:19:28.370 --> 00:19:30.850
Maybe because you suddenly bit me!

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:33.230
So what-nya?

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:35.460
Amu-chan, calm down!

00:19:35.460 --> 00:19:37.980
Sheesh, what are you doing?

00:19:45.680 --> 00:19:47.490
You're really going?

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:48.610
Yes.

00:19:49.030 --> 00:19:51.500
Won't you be relieved to have me gone?

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:53.570
Of course I won't!

00:19:53.570 --> 00:19:56.650
Well, <i>I'm</i> relieved.

00:19:56.650 --> 00:19:59.670
I can finally say goodbye to Japan and...

00:20:00.070 --> 00:20:02.010
To you.

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:03.310
Lulu...

00:20:07.910 --> 00:20:09.180
Don't cry, commoner.

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:11.910
Thank ya.

00:20:13.390 --> 00:20:15.580
I sure will miss them.

00:20:15.580 --> 00:20:16.690
Take care!

00:20:16.990 --> 00:20:17.890
Bye-bye!

00:20:17.890 --> 00:20:18.890
Later-nya.

00:20:18.890 --> 00:20:21.580
Take good care of yourself.

00:20:21.580 --> 00:20:23.280
Farewell.

00:20:23.810 --> 00:20:29.080
I ain't ne'er gonna forget y'all, even after I'm back in France!

00:20:30.820 --> 00:20:36.280
Mademoiselle Hinamori, thank you so much for being Lulu's friend.

00:20:36.280 --> 00:20:40.460
Yes, thank you. I know Lulu had a lot of fun.

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:43.090
It was fun for me, too.

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:44.690
Hinamori Amu.

00:20:46.250 --> 00:20:48.360
This is for you.

00:20:49.400 --> 00:20:50.890
Um...

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:53.840
Don't worry, I won't extract a ? Egg.

00:20:53.840 --> 00:20:56.460
That's not what I was thinking!

00:20:57.510 --> 00:21:00.100
It sure is pretty. You really are talented.

00:21:00.100 --> 00:21:03.150
I want to become a jewelry designer.

00:21:04.250 --> 00:21:05.950
So that's your dream?

00:21:06.250 --> 00:21:07.390
Yup.

00:21:07.390 --> 00:21:10.500
A designer, and a singer, a dancer,

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:16.250
a pilot, a rock climber, a baker, and...

00:21:25.530 --> 00:21:27.830
This is the first time we've shaken hands.

00:21:27.830 --> 00:21:30.580
And it's to say farewell.

00:21:31.200 --> 00:21:34.060
We're friends, you know?

00:21:34.470 --> 00:21:35.710
Yeah.

00:21:35.710 --> 00:21:37.740
We always will be.

00:21:52.860 --> 00:21:54.500
And there she goes.

00:21:54.500 --> 00:21:55.740
Yeah.

00:21:55.740 --> 00:21:59.730
This is Lulu-chi we're talking about! I'm sure she'll be just fine in Paris.

00:21:59.730 --> 00:22:01.780
It's her home country, after all.

00:22:01.780 --> 00:22:03.470
It is?

00:22:03.470 --> 00:22:07.300
And with that, the ? Egg incidents should stop completely.

00:22:07.300 --> 00:22:08.140
Yeah.

00:22:11.950 --> 00:22:14.140
Until we meet again, Amu.

00:22:14.140 --> 00:22:15.530
See y'all!

00:22:31.840 --> 00:22:36.410
Maybe I was wrong to pretend not to notice your worries.

00:22:36.410 --> 00:22:41.220
It's okay if you can't tell me everything.

00:22:41.220 --> 00:22:43.600
With that dark look on your face,

00:22:43.600 --> 00:22:45.840
go ahead and scream dark things.

00:22:45.840 --> 00:22:50.150
You shouldn't leave all those heavy feelings inside.

00:22:50.150 --> 00:22:51.630
Ride On!

00:22:55.020 --> 00:22:57.830
If you don't... If it's like that...

00:22:57.830 --> 00:23:00.750
You couldn't tell me if you wanted to, huh?

00:23:02.010 --> 00:23:04.500
I get it.

00:23:04.500 --> 00:23:07.160
I'm sure your circumstances will change one day.

00:23:07.160 --> 00:23:10.190
That time will come! That time is now!

00:23:14.010 --> 00:23:15.820
Don't you want to have someone

00:23:15.820 --> 00:23:18.450
say congratulations to you once in your life?

00:23:18.450 --> 00:23:23.380
Doesn't the breeze feel nice today?

00:23:23.380 --> 00:23:27.750
Even if you feel like it's all you can do to survive...

00:23:27.750 --> 00:23:32.620
You can make your life into something you enjoy. It's so nice!

00:23:32.620 --> 00:23:37.440
"Everything's for you."

00:23:37.440 --> 00:23:42.040
How about that?

00:23:43.740 --> 00:23:45.190
My boy!

00:23:50.230 --> 00:23:52.260
I love Shugo Chara!

00:23:52.260 --> 00:23:53.610
I love it!

00:23:53.610 --> 00:23:55.050
I really love it!

00:23:55.050 --> 00:23:57.640
Hey, what are you guys yelling about?

00:23:57.640 --> 00:23:59.230
You didn't hear?

00:23:59.230 --> 00:24:02.460
There's an event where you yell out your passion for the one you love!

00:24:02.740 --> 00:24:05.230
Y-Y-Your passion for the one you love?!

00:24:05.230 --> 00:24:08.390
You're imagining naughty things again, aren't you, Amu-chan?

00:24:08.390 --> 00:24:09.990
I am not!

00:24:09.990 --> 00:24:12.280
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:12.280 --> 00:24:13.960
I Want to Tell You These Feelings!

00:24:13.960 --> 00:24:17.390
I wonder if Yoru's voice will reach Ikuto?

00:24:17.390 --> 00:24:19.350
Wait, you mean this is a serious development?
